# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Houses of Hermes: Mystery Cults — House Verditius (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Houses of Hermes: Mystery Cults (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter One (pp. 7–43)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter One’s narrative, verbatim: House Verditius’s history from Birna to the present,
> its customs, the six clans and their septs, the Verditius Council, the Heartbeast and its
> Inner Mysteries, and the Huntress in the Wood. Mechanics are records elsewhere:
> `arm5e-houses-mystery-cults-0.5-verditius.ttrpg`, `arm5e-houses-mystery-cults-0.5-verditius-scripts.ttrpg`,
> `arm5e-houses-mystery-cults-0.5-verditius-spells.ttrpg`, `arm5e-houses-mystery-cults-0.5-verditius-virtues-flaws.ttrpg`,
> `arm5e-houses-mystery-cults-0.5-verditius-abilities.ttrpg` and `arm5e-houses-mystery-cults-0.5-verditius-sidebars.ttrpg`.
> The House itself is the canonical `^"House Verditius"` DEF in `arm5e-0.5-houses.ttrpg`.

